# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Blender
# The pipeline's sources are code (the _build/*.py scripts), not binaries.
# Everything below is generated or re-fetchable, and on this machine it is
# hundreds of MB - far past GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit without LFS:
#
#   Blender/AssetLibrary/Source/PolyHaven   232 MB  re-fetch: fetch_polyhaven.py
#   .recovery/charmorph                     140 MB  re-fetch: fetch_charmorph.sh
#   Working/**.blend (scene builds)         ~600 MB  rebuild: _build/*.py
Blender/AssetLibrary/Source/PolyHaven/
.recovery/
*.blend1
*.blend@
Blender/AssetLibrary/Working/**/*.blend
Blender/AssetLibrary/Working/**/preview_*.png
Blender/AssetLibrary/Working/**/render_*.log
Blender/project/

# Vite build output
dist/
